    "caption": "just made this simple rosemary + clove infusion. nothing fancy, just herbs & hot water. i use it two ways: \u2022 on my scalp + hair as a light spritz \u2022 and as a warm herbal infusion to drink how i make it: fresh rosemary + whole cloves pour hot (not boiling) water over them cover + let it sit overnight (or up to 24 hours) strain and store in a jars.  You can pour water over the herbs 2-3 times to continue extracting the benefits (potent enough for multiple uses) how i store it: one week in the fridge & months in the freezer (ice trays, silicone molds) rosemary: \u2022 supports scalp health \u2022 helps with clarity + focus \u2022 can support stronger-looking hair over time clove: \u2022 warming + grounding \u2022 rich in antioxidants \u2022 supports circulation + digestion i like simple things like this... that support you a little bit everywhere #longhair #naturalhair #hair #rosemary #clove ",
